; [WG_Nummer_aktives_NC_Macro/WG_Nummer_letztes_aktives_NC_Macro]
;   -3  -> last NC macro aborted
;   -2  -> last NC program aborted
;   -1  -> last NC macro finished
;    0  -> no NC macro called
;    1  -> NC macro M01 running
;    2  -> NC macro M02 running
;   ..
; 1000  -> BS_INIT macro running
; 1001  -> TOOLCALL macro running
; 1002  -> Alternate operation macro running
; 1003  -> Pallet change macro running
; 1004  -> AFC macro running
; 1005  -> TO_Clamp macro running
; 1006  -> TO_TOOLCALL macro running
; 1007  -> TO Pallet change macro running
